  "releaseNotes": "Structured error handling. BREAKING: ApiException moved from Satya.Sdk.Internal to the Satya.Sdk namespace (remove \"using Satya.Sdk.Internal;\"). BREAKING: VetStatus.NotVetted removed; VetStatus is now Cleared, Pending or Suspected. BREAKING: public ApiException.FromHttp removed. BREAKING (API behavior): POST /vetting/vet no longer returns 400 for every failure; image/face problems return 422, quota exhaustion returns 429 (query_limit_reached), and transient upstream failures return 503 (service_temporarily_unavailable). NEW: ApiException.ErrorCode, Title, Detail, TraceId, RequestId and IsTransient (true for 408 and 5xx), parsed from ProblemDetails and ApiError responses on every error path. NEW: SatyaErrorCodes constants for branching on ErrorCode. ApiException.Message now prefers the ProblemDetails detail, then the ApiError message, then the title, then a generic message. CHANGED: default SatyaClientOptions.Timeout raised from 3 to 5 minutes.",
